  "description": "The `rask` .NET tool: a productivity front-door for the Rask framework. Scaffold a new project (`rask new`), run it with hot reload (`rask dev`), manage EF Core migrations (`rask db`), and deploy to a single host over SSH with auto-HTTPS (`rask deploy`) — a thin, dependency-free wrapper over the .NET SDK. Install with `dotnet tool install -g Rask.Cli`.",
